Output assets/demo.gif

Set Shell "zsh"
Set FontSize 20
Set Width 1200
Set Height 700
Set Theme "Dracula"
Set TypingSpeed 35ms

Type `node scripts/audit-post.mjs --text "just shipped this. grab it at github.com/themattberman/x-algo-skill"`
Enter
Sleep 5s
Type "clear"
Enter
Sleep 1s
Type "node scripts/audit-post.mjs --self-test"
Enter
Sleep 5s
